{
  "$schema": "../node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "mutate": [
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/data-routes/stats.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/data-routes/adapters.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/ui-routes/context.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/ui-routes/health.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/ui-routes/trend.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/ui-routes/ui-config.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/ui-routes/events.ts",
    "packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/report-routes/reports.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/client/**",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/**/interface.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/*/deps.ts",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/**/*.d.mts",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/adapters/deepseek-official.mjs",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/adapters/opencode-go.mjs",
    "!packages/dsh-provider-usage/src/server/adapters/zai-coding-cn.mjs"
  ],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "mutator": {
    "excludedMutations": [
      "StringLiteral",
      "ArrayLiteral",
      "ObjectLiteral",
      "TemplateLiteral"
    ]
  },
  "plugins": [
    "@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"
  ],
  "concurrency": 16,
  "timeoutMS": 60000,
  "dryRunTimeoutMinutes": 5,
  "reporters": [
    "progress",
    "clear-text",
    "json"
  ],
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "vitest": {
    "related": false,
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.d/dsh-provider-usage-routes.config.ts"
  },
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "coverage/mutation/dsh-provider-usage-routes.json"
  },
  "incremental": true,
  "incrementalFile": "coverage/mutation/incremental-provider-usage-routes.json",
  "_comment": "阶段一新段（评审 P1-5 前置）：E5/C6 路由面——stats+adapters+ui+reports；先抽纯函数（clampTrendN/isReportPeriodValid/isReportKeyValid/isTaskIdValid）补 unit-routes 再开段；testFiles 含 unit-routes/unit-report/unit-apply；#768 D10 stats/adapters 两文件由 domain1/routes 改名迁 server/data-routes（路径同步，零行为变更，杀灭面新增 test/integration/data-routes/composition-root）；#768 D11 reports 由 domain2/routes 迁 server/report-routes（interface 门面 + deps 注入面 + 配置窄口消费，零行为变更，杀灭面新增 test/integration/report-routes/composition-root，逆序释放判据锁定）；#768 D12 ui 四块（health/trend/ui-config/events）+ 装配形状（context）由 domain2/routes 迁 server/ui-routes（一域四块不升域，interface 门面 + deps 注入面 + 广播窄口，零行为变更，杀灭面新增 test/integration/ui-routes/composition-root，健康读 errsurf 与 SSE 非可靠判据锁定）。"
}
